<title>USA: Republic has no comment on Western.</title>
<headline>Republic has no comment on Western.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said it had no comment on Western Resources Inc's plans to oppose its acquisition of ADT Ltd.</p>
<p>Western, which holds a 24.3 percent stake in ADT, earlier said it will oppose the transaction that originally was announced in July.</p>
<p>ADT could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723</p>
</text>
